  m_text: "<align=justified>\n<size=110%>\nPoint your cursor at any object and press
    \u201CE\u201D to pick it up, while holding it press \u201CR\u201D to rotate it,
    or \u201CI\u201D to inspect it\u2019s details. You can then place the selected
    wand at the workstation and package it into the appropriate sized wandbox, by
    pressing \u201CF\u201D while looking at the workstation.\n\n\r\nOnce packed,
    you can store it in one the shelves, try to do Mr. Ollivander justice by restoring
    his shop to it\u2019s former glory.\n\nYou will also find torn pages of this
    journal around the map, they'll guide you on what to do or possibly grant you
    magical powers.\n</size>\n</align>\r\n"
