  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<align=center>

    <size=150%><b>Welcome To The Abandoned Wand Shop!</b></size>


    <size=70%><i>This
    is Team Bombocat Placeholder''s take on the concept "Thirdspace". We hope you
    enjoy. </i> </align>

    <align=justified>

    <size=100%>

    Our setting
    is simple: a shop that has long been abandoned following the passing of its owner
    and the slow fade into obsolescence of its trade.


    The protagonist discovers
    this humble shop, rich with history, and decides to honour its legacy by tidying
    it up, following the journal they find within.


    The game is a simple, relaxing
    experience set in an atmospheric and homely environment. Your goal is to organise
    the shop by returning everything to its original position.

    </size>

    </align>

'
